OL,3,GNEWSARider dies after serious accident
OL,4,Aplaying polo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died following a serious
OL,7,Faccident during a polo match in West
OL,8,FSussex.
OL,10,FCowdray Park Polo Club in Easebourne
OL,11,Fsaid it was "devastated" after Harry
OL,12,FRevell died following the incident on
OL,13,F11 September.
OL,15,FThe club described him as a "much-loved
OL,16,Fand respected member of the polo
OL,17,Fcommunity" and said its thoughts were
OL,18,F"first and foremost with his wife,
OL,19,Ffamily, friends and teammates at this
OL,20,Fincredibly difficult time".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
